[00:14.24]A paradise our God has promised,
[00:20.22]By means of Christ’s Millennial Reign,
[00:27.22]When he’ll blot out all sin and error,
[00:33.29]Removing death and tears and pain.
[00:38.87](Chorus)
[00:39.02]A paradise, the earth will be.
[00:46.54]With eyes of faith, this we can see.
[00:51.88]This promise Christ will soon fulfill,
[00:59.18]For he delights to do God’s will.
[01:05.96]Soon here on earth, as God has purposed,
[01:16.98]His Son will cause the dead to rise.
[01:23.90]Then it will be as Jesus promised:
[01:30.36]‘You’ll be with me in Paradise.’
[01:35.57](Chorus)
[01:35.72]A paradise, the earth will be.
[01:43.32]With eyes of faith, this we can see.
[01:48.73]This promise Christ will soon fulfill,
[01:55.86]For he delights to do God’s will.
[02:02.06]The Paradise, our Lord has promised,
[02:22.26]And he is now our reigning King.
[02:28.35]We daily thank our loving Father,
[02:35.16]And from our hearts, his praises sing.
[02:40.41](Chorus)
[02:40.56]A paradise, the earth will be.
[02:48.14]With eyes of faith, this we can see.
[02:53.74]This promise Christ will soon fulfill,
[03:01.06]For he delights to do God’s will.
